---
layout: base.njk
title: "Digital Agency & Technology Solutions in Liberia"
description: "TechFun Universe is a digital agency in Monrovia, Liberia building websites, mobile apps, custom software, and AI solutions for businesses, schools, NGOs, and entrepreneurs across West Africa."
permalink: "/index.html"
---
<section class="hero">
  <svg class="hero-arc" viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none">
    <path d="M120 20 C 260 40, 380 140, 360 260 C 345 350, 250 380, 170 360" stroke="#FF7A00" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85"/>
    <circle cx="170" cy="360" r="7" fill="#FF7A00"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Digital Agency — Monrovia, Liberia</span>
    <h1 style="color:#fff;">Transforming Your Ideas into Digital Experiences</h1>
    <p class="lead">We design and build websites, mobile apps, custom software, and AI-powered tools for businesses, schools, NGOs, and entrepreneurs across Liberia and West Africa.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Project</a>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn-ghost">See Our Work</a>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-strip">
      <div><div class="stat-num"><span data-count="{{ stats.projects }}" data-suffix="+">0</span></div><div class="stat-label">Projects Delivered</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num"><span data-count="{{ stats.clients }}" data-suffix="+">0</span></div><div class="stat-label">Happy Clients</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num"><span data-count="{{ stats.years }}" data-suffix="">0</span></div><div class="stat-label">Years Building</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num"><span data-count="24" data-suffix="/7">0</span></div><div class="stat-label">Support Available</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span>
      <h2>Six ways we help you move faster</h2>
      <p>From your first landing page to a full custom platform, we build the technology your organization actually needs — nothing bolted on, nothing you'll outgrow in a year.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🌐</div>
        <h3>Website Design &amp; Development</h3>
        <p>Corporate sites, e-commerce, schools, churches, NGOs, and government portals — fast, secure, and easy to update yourself.</p>
        <a href="/services/#web" class="card-link">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">📱</div>
        <h3>Mobile App Development</h3>
        <p>Android, iOS, and cross-platform apps for delivery, booking, healthcare, school, and business use cases.</p>
        <a href="/mobile-apps/" class="card-link">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🖥️</div>
        <h3>Custom Software Development</h3>
        <p>Business management, payroll, inventory, school and hospital systems, CRM, ERP, and multi-tenant SaaS platforms.</p>
        <a href="/software/" class="card-link">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🤖</div>
        <h3>AI Solutions</h3>
        <p>AI business assistants, chatbots, workflow automation, and intelligent search built into tools your team already uses.</p>
        <a href="/services/#ai" class="card-link">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">📈</div>
        <h3>Digital Marketing</h3>
        <p>SEO, social media management, Google Business optimization, and email marketing that brings the right people to you.</p>
        <a href="/services/#marketing" class="card-link">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🎨</div>
        <h3>Branding &amp; Graphics</h3>
        <p>Logos, company profiles, brochures, and full brand identity systems that make you look as sharp as you are.</p>
        <a href="/services/#branding" class="card-link">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Flagship Products</span>
      <h2>Software we've already built — ready to adapt for you</h2>
      <p>Instead of starting from zero, many clients launch faster on one of our proven platforms, customized to their operation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card"><span class="badge">Business</span><h3>TFU Business Manager Pro</h3><p>All-in-one operations, invoicing, and reporting platform for growing SMEs.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="badge">Education</span><h3>TFU School Management Pro</h3><p>Admissions, grading, attendance, and parent communication in one system.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="badge">Construction</span><h3>Construction Workforce Manager</h3><p>Track crews, equipment, site progress, and project costs from anywhere.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="badge">AI</span><h3>AI Business Assistant</h3><p>A trained assistant that answers customer questions and handles routine tasks 24/7.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="badge">Retail</span><h3>Inventory &amp; POS System</h3><p>Point-of-sale, stock tracking, and sales reporting built for local retail.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="badge">HR</span><h3>HR &amp; Payroll System</h3><p>Staff records, payroll runs, and leave management without the spreadsheets.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid-2" style="align-items:center; gap: var(--space-6);">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Why Choose Us</span>
      <h2>Built by people who understand your market</h2>
      <p>We're a Monrovia-based team building for clients across Liberia, West Africa, and beyond. That means solutions built for local connectivity, payment methods, and business realities — not generic templates.</p>
      <div class="grid" style="gap: var(--space-2); margin-top: var(--space-3);">
        <div><strong style="color:var(--navy-deep);">Local + reliable.</strong> <span style="color:var(--slate);">Support in your timezone, in person when you need it.</span></div>
        <div><strong style="color:var(--navy-deep);">Built to scale.</strong> <span style="color:var(--slate);">Every project is architected so it can grow into something bigger.</span></div>
        <div><strong style="color:var(--navy-deep);">Fixed pricing, no surprises.</strong> <span style="color:var(--slate);">Clear packages and quotes before we start.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-strip" style="justify-content:flex-start;">
      <span>Schools</span><span>NGOs</span><span>Construction</span><span>Healthcare</span><span>Hospitality</span><span>Finance</span><span>Churches</span><span>Government</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">How We Work</span>
      <h2>From your idea to a live product</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">01</div><h3>Discover</h3><p>We learn your goals, users, and constraints in a free consultation.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">02</div><h3>Design</h3><p>You review real screens and flows before a single line of code is written.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">03</div><h3>Build</h3><p>We develop in the open, with regular check-ins and working previews.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">04</div><h3>Launch &amp; Support</h3><p>We deploy, train your team, and stay on for maintenance and growth.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Client Results</span>
      <h2>What our clients say</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for item in collections.testimonials %}
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <p class="quote">"{{ item.data.quote }}"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-person">
          <div class="avatar">{{ item.data.name | truncate(2, true, '') | upper }}</div>
          <div><div class="person-name">{{ item.data.name }}</div><div class="person-role">{{ item.data.role }}</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Recent Work</span>
      <h2>A few projects we're proud of</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for item in collections.portfolioItems | reverse %}
        {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        <div class="card">
          <div class="badge">{{ item.data.category | capitalize }}</div>
          <h3>{{ item.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ item.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn-outline-navy">View Full Portfolio</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <h2>Let's build something amazing</h2>
      <p>Tell us what you're trying to solve. We'll respond within one business day with next steps.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Discovery Call</a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="btn btn-ghost">See Pricing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
